":"xh30-3-01-q042","number":42,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"秋天到了，早上和晚上都挺（ ）的。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"可是"},{"id":"B","text":"丢"},{"id":"C","text":"耳机"},{"id":"D","text":"常常"},{"id":"E","text":"种"},{"id":"F","text":"凉快"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q043","number":43,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"妈妈（ ）告诉我，做事情一定要认真。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"可是"},{"id":"B","text":"丢"},{"id":"C","text":"耳机"},{"id":"D","text":"常常"},{"id":"E","text":"种"},{"id":"F","text":"凉快"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q044","number":44,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"他在学校把书包（ ）了，现在很着急。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"可是"},{"id":"B","text":"丢"},{"id":"C","text":"耳机"},{"id":"D","text":"常常"},{"id":"E","text":"种"},{"id":"F","text":"凉快"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q045","number":45,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"这个题看起来很简单，（ ）我做了半天还没做出来。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"可是"},{"id":"B","text":"丢"},{"id":"C","text":"耳机"},{"id":"D","text":"常常"},{"id":"E","text":"种"},{"id":"F","text":"凉快"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q046","number":46,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":"第二部分\n第 46～50 题","prompt":"A：我做了一个蛋糕，你（ ）一下吧。\nB：真好吃！你做得太好了。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q047","number":47,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：这些菜（ ）吗？\nB：放心吧，是我今天早上刚买的。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q048","number":48,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：明天的考试几点开始？\nB：九点，但是我们八点半以前（ ）到教室。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q049","number":49,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：你在看什么书？\nB：一本（ ）中国茶文化的书，写得很有意思。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q050","number":50,"type":"word_cloze","instruction":null,"prompt":"A：这个汉字是什么意思？\nB：我也不知道，你查一下（ ）吧。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q051","number":51,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":"第三部分\n第 51～60 题","prompt":"★ 关于小文，可以知道什么？","passage":"以前上汉语课，我坐在教室最后面，常常听不清楚老师读的句子，笔记也记得很少。这个星期，同学小文跟我换了地方，我终于坐到了前面。","passageId":"p051","options":[{"id":"A","text":"笔记记得很少"},{"id":"B","text":"以前坐在最后面"},{"id":"C","text":"现在坐在教室后面"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q052","number":52,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于小刘，可以知道什么？","passage":"同事小刘的手机没电了，可她马上要给客人打电话，就借了我的手机。第二天，她请我喝了一杯咖啡，说谢谢我帮了她。","passageId":"p052","options":[{"id":"A","text":"忘了带手机"},{"id":"B","text":"用过我的手机"},{"id":"C","text":"请客人喝了咖啡"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q053","number":53,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 哥哥做了什么？","passage":"快要过节了，星期六我和家人一起打扫房子。哥哥把地扫得很干净，我洗了杯子和盘子，妈妈做了几个菜。","passageId":"p053","options":[{"id":"A","text":"扫地"},{"id":"B","text":"洗盘子"},{"id":"C","text":"做几个菜"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q054","number":54,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 他现在住的房间：","passage":"我的房间在西边，夏天下午太阳照进来，屋子里特别热，只能开空调。上个月我搬到了东边那间，下午不开空调也不热。","passageId":"p054","options":[{"id":"A","text":"比以前更热"},{"id":"B","text":"是西边那间"},{"id":"C","text":"不用开空调"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q055","number":55,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于那家书店，可以知道什么？","passage":"我家附近以前没有书店，想买书得坐很久的车。今年和以前不同了，小区门口开了一家书店，晚上十点才关门。","passageId":"p055","options":[{"id":"A","text":"是今年开的"},{"id":"B","text":"离我家比较远"},{"id":"C","text":"早上十点开门"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q056","number":56,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于弟弟，可以知道什么？","passage":"弟弟每天放学回家，总是先洗澡，然后再复习今天学的课文。他说洗完澡以后身体舒服极了，学习的时候也更认真。","passageId":"p056","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不喜欢洗澡"},{"id":"B","text":"学习前先洗澡"},{"id":"C","text":"复习完才去洗澡"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q057","number":57,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于小高的相机，可以知道什么？","passage":"小高是一名大学生，从小就喜欢拍照。去年生日的时候，爸爸送了他一个相机。现在每个周末他都会带着它去动物园，给大熊猫照相。那儿的大熊猫又胖又可爱，总是在树下吃东西，吃饱了就爬到树上睡觉。小高想以后多练习，把照片照得更好。","passageId":"p057","options":[{"id":"A","text":"刚买的"},{"id":"B","text":"是生日礼物"},{"id":"C","text":"是哥哥送给他的"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q058","number":58,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 根据这段话，大熊猫：","passage":"小高是一名大学生，从小就喜欢拍照。去年生日的时候，爸爸送了他一个相机。现在每个周末他都会带着它去动物园，给大熊猫照相。那儿的大熊猫又胖又可爱，总是在树下吃东西，吃饱了就爬到树上睡觉。小高想以后多练习，把照片照得更好。","passageId":"p057","options":[{"id":"A","text":"睡在树上"},{"id":"B","text":"在树下睡觉"},{"id":"C","text":"在树上吃东西"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q059","number":59,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 关于那个公园，可以知道什么？","passage":"我和爱人住的小区旁边有一个公园，里面到处都是树和草地。每个周末，只要天气不错，我们就会带着女儿去那儿走走。女儿今年上小学三年级，她最喜欢坐在草地上听她爸爸讲故事。我们一般下午四点出发，六点前回家做晚饭。","passageId":"p059","options":[{"id":"A","text":"树很多"},{"id":"B","text":"在学校旁边"},{"id":"C","text":"下午四点开门"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q060","number":60,"type":"reading_passage","instruction":null,"prompt":"★ 根据这段话，女儿：","passage":"我和爱人住的小区旁边有一个公园，里面到处都是树和草地。每个周末，只要天气不错，我们就会带着女儿去那儿走走。女儿今年上小学三年级，她最喜欢坐在草地上听她爸爸讲故事。我们一般下午四点出发，六点前回家做晚饭。","passageId":"p059","options":[{"id":"A","text":"每天去公园"},{"id":"B","text":"上小学四年级"},{"id":"C","text":"爱听爸爸讲故事"}],"images":[],"needsReview":false}]},{"id":"writing","title":"Writing","questions":[{"id":"xh30-3-01-q061","number":61,"type":"character_fill","instruction":"第一部分\n第 61～65 题","prompt":"这两件衬衫都很好看，我不知道该怎么（ ）择。","pinyin":"xuǎn","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q062","number":62,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"王明今天一（ ）在办公室开会，没有时间吃午饭。","pinyin":"zhí","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q063","number":63,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"经理每天早上来办公室，先看一会儿（ ）纸。","pinyin":"bào","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q064","number":64,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"我们的数学老师上课（ ）别认真，大家都很喜欢她。","pinyin":"tè","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q065","number":65,"type":"character_fill","instruction":null,"prompt":"弟弟（ ）是玩手机到很晚，早上一点儿也不想起床。","pinyin":"zǒng","options":[],"images":[],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q066","number":66,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":"第二部分\n第 66～70 题","prompt":"礼物","options":[],"images":["assets/q066.72c21f38f61a.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Người mẹ mỉm cười đưa hộp quà màu đỏ cho con gái nhỏ đang vui vẻ đưa hai tay ra nhận."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q067","number":67,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"哭","options":[],"images":["assets/q067.4c7bf18472b0.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một cậu bé vừa khóc vừa đi tìm người trong siêu thị."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q068","number":68,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"出院","options":[],"images":["assets/q068.70033b82a360.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Ông cụ tươi cười bước ra khỏi cửa bệnh viện cùng cháu trai xách túi, cô y tá vẫy tay chào tạm biệt."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q069","number":69,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"回答","options":[],"images":["assets/q069.f700d9e64954.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Trong lớp học, một nam sinh đứng dậy trả lời câu hỏi, cô giáo gật đầu lắng nghe."],"needsReview":false},{"id":"xh30-3-01-q070","number":70,"type":"writing_sentence","instruction":null,"prompt":"换","options":[],"images":["assets/q070.5dbbbf493a25.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một cô gái trẻ ngồi trên ghế trong cửa hàng giày, đang mang thử đôi giày trắng, bên cạnh là đôi giày cao gót màu đen vừa cởi ra."],"needsReview":false}]}],"examples":[{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 1～5 题","prompt":"女：这个路口车比较多，要看红绿灯。\n男：现在是红灯，我们等一下吧。","options":[{"id":"A","text":""},{"id":"B","text":""},{"id":"C","text":""},{"id":"D","text":""},{"id":"E","text":""},{"id":"F","text":""}],"images":["assets/q001-bank-A.8d3208395eef.jpg","assets/q001-bank-B.de82a6882a9a.jpg","assets/q001-bank-C.0ab3cc5f32db.jpg","assets/q001-bank-D.6084ba24e523.jpg","assets/q001-bank-E.d60ec669055d.jpg","assets/q001-bank-F.f47b83198e43.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một bé gái đang chăm chú xem tấm bản đồ thế giới lớn trải trên bàn.","Một cậu học sinh đang ngồi trước giá vẽ, cầm cọ vẽ tranh.","Một chàng trai trẻ đang bơi rất nhanh trong làn bơi của hồ bơi.","Một cô lớn tuổi đang giúp một cô gái trẻ khiêng chiếc thùng lớn trên cầu thang chung cư.","Trong thư viện, một cô gái đặt ngón tay lên môi nhắc chàng trai nói nhỏ lại.","Một người đàn ông và một người phụ nữ đứng chờ đèn đỏ ở ngã tư đông xe."],"answer":"F","fromNumber":1,"toNumber":5},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 11～20 题","prompt":"女：你放学后去跑步了吗？\n男：去了，我终于跑了三千米，比上星期多一千米呢！\n问：男的这次跑了多少米？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"一千米"},{"id":"B","text":"两千米"},{"id":"C","text":"三千米"}],"images":[],"answer":"C","fromNumber":11,"toNumber":20},{"instruction":"第三部分\n第 21～30 题","prompt":"网站上买的裤子颜色挺好看，也不贵，可是有点儿小，我想换条大的。\n问：说话人为什么想换裤子？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"不便宜"},{"id":"B","text":"颜色难看"},{"id":"C","text":"大小不合适"}],"images":[],"answer":"C","fromNumber":21,"toNumber":30},{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 31～35 题","prompt":"你哥哥个子真高，他身高多少？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"小王又把我的杯子拿走了，也不问我一下。"},{"id":"B","text":"选了，老师讲课很有意思，我一点儿也不觉得累。"},{"id":"C","text":"新房子离你上班的地方近吗？"},{"id":"D","text":"看到了，房间挺干净的，我就放心了。"},{"id":"E","text":"一米八五，所以他从小就喜欢打篮球。"},{"id":"F","text":"我很想去，可是星期六我得去公司开会。"}],"images":[],"answer":"E","fromNumber":31,"toNumber":35},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 41～45 题","prompt":"我下了课就去商店买一个新（ ）。","options":[{"id":"A","text":"可是"},{"id":"B","text":"丢"},{"id":"C","text":"耳机"},{"id":"D","text":"常常"},{"id":"E","text":"种"},{"id":"F","text":"凉快"}],"images":[],"answer":"C","fromNumber":41,"toNumber":45},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 46～50 题","prompt":"A：这些西瓜多少钱一（ ）？\nB：三块，您要多少？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"新鲜"},{"id":"B","text":"尝"},{"id":"C","text":"必须"},{"id":"D","text":"字典"},{"id":"E","text":"关于"},{"id":"F","text":"斤"}],"images":[],"answer":"F","fromNumber":46,"toNumber":50},{"instruction":"第三部分\n第 51～60 题","prompt":"我家附近就有山，山不太高。每个周末，我都和爸爸骑自行车去那儿，爬到上面只要四十分钟。\n★ 关于那儿的山，可以知道什么？","options":[{"id":"A","text":"山特别高"},{"id":"B","text":"离他家不远"},{"id":"C","text":"爬上去要一小时"}],"images":[],"answer":"B","fromNumber":51,"toNumber":60},{"instruction":"第一部分\n第 61～65 题","prompt":"我哥哥去（ ）开始在银行工作。","pinyin":"nián","options":[],"images":[],"answer":"年","fromNumber":61,"toNumber":65},{"instruction":"第二部分\n第 66～70 题","prompt":"累","options":[],"images":["assets/q066-example.d540ca505a02.jpg"],"imageAlts":["Một chàng trai mặc đồ thể thao vừa chạy xong trong công viên, cúi người chống tay lên gối, mồ hôi nhễ nhại, trông rất mệt."],"answer":"他坚持跑完了，现在非常累。","fromNumber":66,"toNumber":70}],"questionCount":70,"hasAudio":true,"audioUrl":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-audio/xh30-3-01/full.d32ec8ece803.mp3","images":[{"path":"assets/q001-bank-A.8d3208395eef.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-A.8d3208395eef.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-B.de82a6882a9a.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-B.de82a6882a9a.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-C.0ab3cc5f32db.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-C.0ab3cc5f32db.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-D.6084ba24e523.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-D.6084ba24e523.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-E.d60ec669055d.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-E.d60ec669055d.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q001-bank-F.f47b83198e43.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q001-bank-F.f47b83198e43.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-A.bb006860fce2.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q006-bank-A.bb006860fce2.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-B.cbbff9f72aa4.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q006-bank-B.cbbff9f72aa4.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-C.98a4af034400.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q006-bank-C.98a4af034400.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-D.01c2e2b62be1.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q006-bank-D.01c2e2b62be1.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q006-bank-E.a7411c67ca0b.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q006-bank-E.a7411c67ca0b.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q066.72c21f38f61a.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q066.72c21f38f61a.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q067.4c7bf18472b0.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q067.4c7bf18472b0.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q068.70033b82a360.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q068.70033b82a360.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q069.f700d9e64954.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q069.f700d9e64954.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q070.5dbbbf493a25.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q070.5dbbbf493a25.jpg"},{"path":"assets/q066-example.d540ca505a02.jpg","src":"https://static.xiehanzi.com/hsk-tests/xh30-3-01/assets/q066-example.d540ca505a02.jpg"}]}